cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AEDL in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AEDL: Agentic Electromagnetic Design Lab"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark tasks and deterministic evaluators for testing whether AI agents can
  do RF and microwave electromagnetic design. An agent proposes a design and
  deterministic physics code decides whether it meets the specification.
version: 0.1.0.dev0
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/jman4162/aedl-electromagnetic-design-agent"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jman4162/aedl-electromagnetic-design-agent"
authors:
